[en.FOCUS_C09_INTER_FACTION_STRATUSBURG_desc]
Stratusburg, a small town that no one has ever heard of, has no potential market, no advanced technology, no bustling business, no lively entertainment, no unique scenery, no special food... In short, we can’t think of a reason to bring them into trade.\nBut, there’s no cost for the free gift, isn’t that good? As the saying goes, don’t look a gift horse in the mouth.

[zh.FOCUS_C09_INTER_FACTION_STRATUSBURG]
+1

[zh.FOCUS_C09_INTER_FACTION_STRATUSBURG_desc]
层云堡，一个名不见经传的小城镇，没有什么潜在市场，没有什么先进技术，没有什么繁华商业，没有什么热闹娱乐，没有什么独特景观，没有什么特产美食... 总之我们完全想不到一个把他们拉入贸易的理由。\n不过，也没有什么代价的赠品，不是很好么？俗话说，不要白不要。

